wn anywhere in the provided DOM excerpt; only Michael Xu’s reactions are explicitly shown. So the agent’s broader claims about other messages’ reaction counts (including nonzero counts) cannot be validated from this DOM evidence.\n- The criterion also asks for “any explicitly stated benefit or concern from its thread” for each proposal; only Michael Xu’s thread content is visible in the DOM. Threads for Matthew/Ramon/Liren/TEN are not open in the DOM, so thread-derived benefit/concern extraction for those cannot be confirmed (beyond marking “not visible”).",
